    dct:description "The historical scenario has testable fossil and phylogenetic predictions for many genera. Sparse Antarctic evidence and alternative Gondwanan histories prevent full resolution as a general mechanism." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: For southern disjunct plant genera, infer ancestral areas and divergence dates and compare them with Antarctic fossils, paleoclimate, and changing island connections. Support requires Antarctic ancestry during a warm preglacial interval followed by outward lineage splits." ;
